## Weakest accepted cases

- Lowest final RC1 score: **H15 Dior Homme Sport Very Cool Spray**, 94.08.
- Lowest overall robustness: **H08 Dior Homme Cologne 2007**, 90.87%.

Both remain above the declared RC1 gates.

## Evidence boundary

```text
Robust computational release candidates:   23 / 23
Strict measured OAV releases:               0 / 23
Measured authentic-Dior headspace:          0 / 23
Blind physical-equivalence passes:          0 / 23
Skin-use safety releases:                    0 / 23
Authenticated Dior factory formulas:         0 / 23
```

RC1 means the formula survives the declared computational uncertainty and differentiation program. It does not convert computational evidence into physical laboratory evidence.
